    <tags>disk-analyzer disk-space storage treemap developer-tools cleanup windows open-source</tags>
    <summary>Free, open-source disk analyzer and storage cleaner for Windows.</summary>
    <description>SpaceOps scans drives with a parallel Rust engine, shows disk usage as an interactive Direct2D treemap, detects developer clutter (node_modules, Rust target, .NET bin/obj, Python venvs, WSL and Docker virtual disks) and routes every cleanup through the Windows Recycle Bin. Runs fully offline with no telemetry.

Release builds are unsigned until a code-signing certificate is obtained.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/ChadaSaiteja/SpaceOps/releases/tag/vFILL-AFTER-FIRST-RELEASE</releaseNotes>
